<title>PHILIPPINES: Kuok says sets 15 percent stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Kuok says sets 15 percent stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kuok Philippine Properties Inc said on Tuesday its board has approved the declaration of a 15 percent stock dividend.  </p>
<p>In a statement to the Philippine Stock Exchange, Kuok said the stock dividend totalling 501,111,678 shares with a par value of one peso each would be taken from the unrestricted retained earnings of the company as of last December 31.</p>
<p>Record date of shareholders entitled to the dividend would be determined 15 days after approval of the stockholders of the proposal in their annual meeting on May 30</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
</text>
